ars you can you know  wire it back out to your bank account  but the reason we represent it that way  is that  it enables us to  kind of do some of the things that we  want to do without falling squarely into  traditional types of regulatory boxes  and uh you get all the benefits of  having it as cryptocurrency which are  you know you can  transfer it on blockchain payment rails  uh  you're you know taking part in this in  this new ecosystem  and it is a little bit different than  just holding a dollar in a bank account  but  in ways that are largely positive
 

